	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum apud dominum consulem <persName>Müllnerum</persName> te excusare <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>coepissem, quod nihil scripsisses senatui amplissimo, ille res<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>pondit satis bene te hoc officii fecisse nec opus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>esse ampliore scriptione; optat te valere bene.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Domus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>eius per dei gratiam adhuc est sana.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">D. <persName>a Chaam</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>23. huius mensis legatus abiit ad principem <placeName>Sa<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>baudiae</placeName>; aggravit hic omnes merces transeuntes <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> per <placeName>Sabaudiam</placeName> tributis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>novis et maximis; queruntur omnes etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quid effecturus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sit apud pauperem principem et tamen luxu per<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ditum, qui ideo undelibet corradit materiam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>luxus, docebit eventus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Literas mihi creditas his <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>meis inclusas remitto et maximas tibi gratias <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ago; descripsi potiora, ut <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> prima quaque <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>occasione mittam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Ich verman nochmaln, das der <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l1907">Gottshußpundt</placeName> mitt aller geschicklikeit darzuͦ thuͤye <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>und es nitt versume, damitt die andern <placeName>2 <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Pündt</placeName> mitt üch eins syend.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Observasti haud dubie <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>in his <persName>Castellmuͦri</persName> literis, quod dicit adversarios <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>dumtaxat sperare in duo illa Foedera etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Meum cum <persName>Arnoldi</persName> haeredibus negotium tibi totum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>commendo; oro, ne aegre feras, quod eo te obtundo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>toties; posthac nihil amplius dicam ea de re.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Thuͦnd, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>wie ich üch truw und weiß, das irs thuͦnd.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Wo <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>es müglich, diewyl es sunst lang angeständen, hätte ich <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>das gällt gern; dann ich nötig etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Doch gang, wie es <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>möge.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Lassend mich alein wüssen, ob ich zuͦ den <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>andern schuldneren hie stan sölle oder nitt, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>wie ich üch zuͦletst bericht etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Neque ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>neque aliunde ullas habeo literas; pestis impedit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Ubi accepero aliquid, scies.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Affini tuo misi literas <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>per filium meum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">D. legatus nihil scripsi; nes<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>civi illum abiisse <placeName ref="l760">Salodurum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta fratres, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>d. consules.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">26. octobris 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Pestis invasit etiam fratris mei edes <placeName ref="l242">Capellae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
